<DocsLayout title="Getting Started" description="Add X-Ray to your ML pipeline in 5 minutes.">

<h2>Installation</h2>

<pre><code>pip install xray-sdk</code></pre>

<h2>Quick Start</h2>

<p>Wrap your pipeline function with <code>@xray.pipeline</code> and each step with <code>@xray.step</code>:</p>

<pre><code>import xray

xray.init(endpoint="http://localhost:8000")

@xray.pipeline("my-pipeline")
def process(query: str):
    results = retrieve(query)
    ranked = rank(results)
    return filter(ranked)

@xray.step("RETRIEVE")
def retrieve(query: str):
    # Your retrieval logic
    return results

@xray.step("FILTER")
def filter(items):
    for item in items:
        if item.score < 0.5:
            xray.drop(item, "low_score")
            continue
        yield item
</code></pre>

<h2>Configuration</h2>

<p>Configure via environment variables or <code>xray.init()</code>:</p>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Variable</th>
      <th>Default</th>
      <th>Description</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><code>XRAY_ENDPOINT</code></td>
      <td>http://localhost:8000</td>
      <td>Backend URL</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>XRAY_DISABLED</code></td>
      <td>false</td>
      <td>Disable tracing</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>XRAY_SAMPLE_RATE</code></td>
      <td>1.0</td>
      <td>Sampling rate (0-1)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>XRAY_TOP_K</code></td>
      <td>10</td>
      <td>Top candidates to capture</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

